{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BL Werewolf</strong> is a fresh, turn-based werewolf game for up to 10 players, set in a BL world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players split into two factions: the Dosukebe (super-lewd) faction, eager to sneak on Nonke (innocent) students, and the Nonke faction, who want to live peacefully. Your goal is to keep more of your faction alive than the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand Dosukebe Faction With Nightly Sneaks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/9e5544256eb112b50f96fad66d3e0de4.poster.avif?t=1761439218\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/9e5544256eb112b50f96fad66d3e0de4.webm?t=1761439218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/9e5544256eb112b50f96fad66d3e0de4.mp4?t=1761439218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dosukebe students can sneak on members of the Nonke faction at night, <br>turning them into fellow Dosukebe and expanding their ranks with each successful approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Them Go Wild in a Desire Burst!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/ce1949d70c51da739e70c713044f2b30.avif?t=1761439218\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonke students can block the Dosukebe faction\u2019s nightly moves </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and push them into a <strong><i>Desire Burst</i></strong>, turning their lust against them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Five Days of</strong> <strong>Heated</strong>\u00a0<strong>Debate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/2d639f5802289fed5e6cbf05c9af36b4.poster.avif?t=1761439218\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/2d639f5802289fed5e6cbf05c9af36b4.webm?t=1761439218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/2d639f5802289fed5e6cbf05c9af36b4.mp4?t=1761439218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds through a repeating cycle of Daytime, Evening, and Night phases.<br>During the Daytime phase, everyone votes to send one student to Detention, preventing them from acting that night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to detain a Dosukebe (super-lewd) student, you can stop their steamy nightly advances.<br>But if you mistakenly detain a Nonke (innocent) one... there\u2019ll be no escaping the night\u2019s advances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Figure Out Who Got Seduced Last Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/0f5f75ff1f12675d581d15f9eb10e83f.avif?t=1761439218\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To pull off a <strong>nightly approach</strong>, your target must match your <strong>preferred type</strong>.<br>(\u201cUke\u201ds prefer \u201cSeme\u201ds, \u201cSeme\u201ds prefer \u201cUke\u201ds, and \u201cReverse\u201d can go both ways.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify which <strong>Nonke (innocent)</strong> student matches your taste and make your move!<br>Meanwhile, the Nonke side can try to <strong>deduce everyone\u2019s type</strong>\u2014and in doing so, might just expose who the Dosukebe truly are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Items and Special Abilities!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/ebd3ab38f843a85520e617ea0f52a877.avif?t=1761439218\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction\u2014<strong>Dosukebe (super-lewd)</strong> and <strong>Nonke (innocent)</strong>\u2014has roles with unique abilities.<br>For example, the <strong>Fudanshi</strong>, similar to the classic \u201cSeer\u201d in werewolf games, can investigate other players\u2019 <strong>UKE/SEME</strong> types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other roles include the <strong>Macho</strong>, who can <strong>guard</strong> other players from nightly approaches, and the <strong>Discipliner</strong>, who can <strong>force a student into Detention</strong>, ignoring daytime votes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/5b7c5d866417ad907ca068f9f2b56ac8.avif?t=1761439218\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of the game, players are also randomly given items. Use your <strong>items and abilities</strong> wisely to gain the upper hand in discussions and strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add NPCs and Play from 3 Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BL Werewolf is recommended for <strong>7 players</strong>, but you can add <strong>NPCs</strong> to enjoy the game with as few as <strong>3 players</strong>!<br>Up to <strong>10 players</strong> can play simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Launch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320110/84c762e5add040d371889eb4cdeb0dd196ed547b.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3320110?t=1761439218","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/e55080e254555d11501a56778eb8596b7510ba07/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761439218","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/9106830d455dbc44b69b834bfcddc5201c9acce7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761439218","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/9106830d455dbc44b69b834bfcddc5201c9acce7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761439218","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,4,5],"notes":"- Contains indirect sexual expressions between men.\r\n- All characters appearing in this work are 18 years or older.\r\n- This work does not contain sexual violence. All sexual acts depicted are consensual.\r\n- Contains sexual language and expressions, but no sexual graphics."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BL Werewolf</strong> is a fresh, turn-based werewolf game for up to 10 players, set in a BL world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players split into two factions: the Dosukebe (super-lewd) faction, eager to sneak on Nonke (innocent) students, and the Nonke faction, who want to live peacefully. Your goal is to keep more of your faction alive than the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand Dosukebe Faction With Nightly Sneaks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/9e5544256eb112b50f96fad66d3e0de4.poster.avif?t=1761439218\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/9e5544256eb112b50f96fad66d3e0de4.webm?t=1761439218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/9e5544256eb112b50f96fad66d3e0de4.mp4?t=1761439218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dosukebe students can sneak on members of the Nonke faction at night, <br>turning them into fellow Dosukebe and expanding their ranks with each successful approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Them Go Wild in a Desire Burst!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/ce1949d70c51da739e70c713044f2b30.avif?t=1761439218\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonke students can block the Dosukebe faction\u2019s nightly moves </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and push them into a <strong><i>Desire Burst</i></strong>, turning their lust against them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Five Days of</strong> <strong>Heated</strong>\u00a0<strong>Debate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/2d639f5802289fed5e6cbf05c9af36b4.poster.avif?t=1761439218\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/2d639f5802289fed5e6cbf05c9af36b4.webm?t=1761439218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/2d639f5802289fed5e6cbf05c9af36b4.mp4?t=1761439218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds through a repeating cycle of Daytime, Evening, and Night phases.<br>During the Daytime phase, everyone votes to send one student to Detention, preventing them from acting that night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to detain a Dosukebe (super-lewd) student, you can stop their steamy nightly advances.<br>But if you mistakenly detain a Nonke (innocent) one... there\u2019ll be no escaping the night\u2019s advances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Figure Out Who Got Seduced Last Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/0f5f75ff1f12675d581d15f9eb10e83f.avif?t=1761439218\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To pull off a <strong>nightly approach</strong>, your target must match your <strong>preferred type</strong>.<br>(\u201cUke\u201ds prefer \u201cSeme\u201ds, \u201cSeme\u201ds prefer \u201cUke\u201ds, and \u201cReverse\u201d can go both ways.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify which <strong>Nonke (innocent)</strong> student matches your taste and make your move!<br>Meanwhile, the Nonke side can try to <strong>deduce everyone\u2019s type</strong>\u2014and in doing so, might just expose who the Dosukebe truly are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Items and Special Abilities!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/ebd3ab38f843a85520e617ea0f52a877.avif?t=1761439218\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction\u2014<strong>Dosukebe (super-lewd)</strong> and <strong>Nonke (innocent)</strong>\u2014has roles with unique abilities.<br>For example, the <strong>Fudanshi</strong>, similar to the classic \u201cSeer\u201d in werewolf games, can investigate other players\u2019 <strong>UKE/SEME</strong> types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other roles include the <strong>Macho</strong>, who can <strong>guard</strong> other players from nightly approaches, and the <strong>Discipliner</strong>, who can <strong>force a student into Detention</strong>, ignoring daytime votes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/extras/5b7c5d866417ad907ca068f9f2b56ac8.avif?t=1761439218\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of the game, players are also randomly given items. Use your <strong>items and abilities</strong> wisely to gain the upper hand in discussions and strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add NPCs and Play from 3 Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BL Werewolf is recommended for <strong>7 players</strong>, but you can add <strong>NPCs</strong> to enjoy the game with as few as <strong>3 players</strong>!<br>Up to <strong>10 players</strong> can play simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u7269\u90e8\u30e2\u30ce\u5b50","\u661f\u5b88\u308c\u3093\u3052"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320110/8a996edebf8371db866e894d9d1c4a5c9e43c09f/header.jpg?t=1761439218","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/33